313	// ============================================================================
314	// Shared feed ring buffer
315	// ============================================================================
316	//
317	// Only populated on the hook container — the dashboard container reads it
318	// cross-origin from DREDD_HOOK_URL/api/feed. Kept here because tests and
319	// benchmark harnesses used to exercise the feed directly.
