1	/**
2	 * Hook-facing HTTP server.
3	 *
4	 * Hosts the hot path: POST /intent, /evaluate, /track, /end, /pivot,
5	 * /compact, /register. Plus status endpoints: /health, /api/health,
6	 * /api/data-status, /api/whoami. Plus the feed (cross-origin from the
7	 * dashboard) and the runtime mode toggle.
8	 *
9	 * What deliberately does NOT live here: dashboard HTML, session listings,
10	 * log file downloads, policies dump. Those live in `server-dashboard.ts`
11	 * and run in a separate container behind OIDC.
12	 *
13	 * CORS: /api/feed and /api/mode accept cross-origin requests from
14	 * DREDD_DASHBOARD_ORIGIN so the dashboard container's page can call them.
15	 * Every other endpoint is same-origin (the hook calls its own URL directly).
16	 */
17	
